  "thumbnail_url": null,
  "body": "<p>As an extension of <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/209791877-How-do-I-selectively-disable-notifications-for-specific-servers-\">muting channels</a>, you can make any server's channel list a little more compact by <strong>hiding muted channels</strong>. There are a couple of ways to do this: </p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\">1.</span></strong><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"> Mute desired channels</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\">You can mute the channels you want to hide, either by clicking the bell icon in the top-right corner:</span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058112992\" alt=\"Capture60.jpg\"></span></p>\n<p>... Or by opening up the server's notification settings, accessed here:</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058113132\" alt=\"Capture61.jpg\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\">2.</span></strong><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"> Click the 'Hide Muted Channels' option in the Server Settings Dropdown Menu</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\">Once you click the Server Name (in the upper left corner), you'll see the 'Hide Muted Channels' option in the Server Settings dropdown menu. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\">Clicking that option will hide any muted channels away, leaving just your desired channels:</span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Before:</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360098007513\" alt=\"hide_muted_channels_ticked_off.png\"><br><br>After: </span></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360098007553\" alt=\"hide_muted_channels_ticked_on.png\"></p>",
